sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Client A
    participant S as Server
    participant R as Redis
    participant B as Client B

    A->>R: SET fl:agg_lock token_A NX PX 5000
    R-->>A: OK (lock obținut)

    B->>R: SET fl:agg_lock token_B NX PX 5000
    R-->>B: nil (lock ocupat, retry după 0,3s)

    A->>R: GET fl:weights + fl:round
    R-->>A: model global curent

    Note over A,S: agregare model global

    A->>R: SET fl:weights (model actualizat)
    A->>R: EVAL script Lua (eliberare lock)
    R-->>A: lock eliberat

    B->>R: SET fl:agg_lock token_B NX PX 5000
    R-->>B: OK (lock obținut)
    B->>R: GET fl:weights + fl:round
